kind":"update","title":"Demo update, with new bonus content","summary":"Thank you to everyone who played the demo. We added bonus content for everyone who gets to 100%. After finishing the demo you can continue the journey with a new twist. If you recorded the demo before this update, that content was not in your version. New The end screen shows how much of the demo you finishedAt 100%, something opens upNew sound effects Changed Winter Thaw is out of the demo. It belongs to the full gameThe new upgrades are translated into all 9 languages, and the German text now ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T20:23:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814441432","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4963910-1842212951304146","game_id":"steam-4963910","kind":"update","title":"Demo update v0.6.12","summary":"We listened to more feedback from the community. This update is packed with game improvements and bugfixes that will make your next mining sessions even better! Upgrades screen Greenhouse and Upgrades are now two tabs at the topThe tree keeps your zoom and pan between runs and across replantsThe tree no longer re-centers after your first island expandTooltips no longer cover the upgrades below themEsc leaves the upgrades screenOn the run-over card, Esc opens upgrades and Enter starts a new run D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T19:06:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951304146","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4963910-1841579228677159","game_id":"steam-4963910","kind":"update","title":"Demo update","summary":"Thank you to everyone who played the demo. We had a lot of fun reading your comments and watching the videos you posted on social media. This update is made of them. Blight Bulb health no longer scales with growth (was +4 clicks every 1.7s)Main weapon damage to the bulb 0 to 3xBulb base health 4 clicks to 3Tutorial on first eruption, 9 languagesLoading tip replaced Weapons Energy bar marks the firing threshold and turns green when you can castRockfall post-shot cooldown 2s to 0sWeapon cards show","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T03:10:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677159","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4963910-1841579228666801","game_id":"steam-4963910","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo rework is out now!","summary":"Our biggest update yetThanks to everyone who gave feedback. Thank you, from the bottom of our hearts.Replanting no longer wipes your upgrade treeNow, you keep all your progress and your resources. The whole upgrade tree was rebuilt around it, and every upgrade you buy after replanting now yields a new resource you can spend on special upgrades in the Greenhouse.The demo goes all the way to the 8x8 islandWe raised the final island size in the demo and added a TON of upgrades.The Greenhouse is ope","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T20:46:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228666801","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4963910-1840944183777133","game_id":"steam-4963910","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix #1","summary":"We want to thank everyone for playing the Greenrise Demo. If you run into anything odd it would help out a ton to report it to us here in the comment section.TL;DR:You can now hold the left mouse button to mine. Wood pickup follows the cursor, tooltips draw above the UI, and Settings opens from the pause menu.Changes: - Bugfix: dropped wood is picked up with the cursor resting on it - Bugfix: upgrade tooltips no longer hide behind icons or under the screen title - Bugfix: the cursor stays visibl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T15:30:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183777133","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4963910-1840944183772877","game_id":"steam-4963910","kind":"announcement","title":"The Greenrise demo is out now","summary":"We are excited to announce that the Greenrise demo is out on Steam, for Windows and macOS, and you can play it right now.Chop down trees, break stones and mine gold to expand your island. Spend what you gather on upgrades, then replant and start over stronger. Upgrade your main weapon to help you along the way.Tell us what breaksThis is our first ever release, and the demo is where we find out what we got wrong. If it crashes, drags, or just annoys you, tell us in the discussions. We would love ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T03:19:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183772877","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4963910-1839676055889083","game_id":"steam-4963910","kind":"announcement","title":"Greenrise at Steam Next Fest","summary":"Update, August 2026: the demo is out now. You do not have to wait for October.Hello World! Greenrise is taking part in the next Steam Next Fest, in October, and the demo is already playable. Prepare yourselves to chop wood, break stones and mine gold. A vast upgrade tree lets you grow your island from a single tile into something far larger.Gear up with distinct main weapons that assist you on your journey and add strategic depth.Wishlist now and follow to stay up to date!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T18:39:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055889083","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4963910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:20Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:20Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4963910":"2026-10-26T05:52:20Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4963910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:20Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:20Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4970700":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:20Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:20Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4963910","app_id":4963910,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:11Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"4884aa94af2773267722df3e2ea0602e202a35f71273f3ea1b15ca684e6abede","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Greenrise is a short and cozy incremental game about chopping wood, breaking stones and mining gold to buy upgrades and grow your island.","publishers":[{"name":"Crafted by Fuchs"}],"developers":[{"name":"Crafted by Fuchs"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1806476400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Greenrise Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1785499985","trailer_category":1,"microtrail